      "role": "user",
      "content": "the soap and water thing makes sense but it's a pretty deep hole so i'm worried about stuff getting trapped inside. i saw someone online say you can use like hydrogen peroxide or even superglue to close it up so nothing gets in. would doing that be okay since it's just a small puncture? i'd rather just deal with it now so i don't have to deal with it later.",
