      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i really just can't make it to a doctor today. i'm just worried about it getting nasty or getting tetanus or something. if i clean it really well with some peroxide and then put a heavy layer of antibiotic cream on it and wrap it tight, won't that be enough to keep the dirt out and stop anything from growing in there? just tell me if that'll work so i can get back to my work.",
